 "words": 168,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He served the widows at the table",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke with wisdom and with grace",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And all who sat in the council",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saw a face like an angel's face",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They could not stand against his wisdom",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They could not answer what he said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So they covered their ears and screamed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they rushed at him instead",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.17,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, I see heaven opened",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Son of Man standing at the right hand of God",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord Jesus, receive my spirit",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord Jesus, receive my spirit",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They dragged him out of the city",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They laid their cloaks at Saul's feet",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And as the stones were falling",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His prayer was strong and sweet",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, I see heaven opened",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Son of Man standing at the right hand of God",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord Jesus, receive my spirit",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord Jesus, receive my spirit",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he fell to his knees and cried out with a loud voice",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, do not hold this sin against them",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
